    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d42">

                <pb facs="0060" n="48" sameAs="frus:frus1942v04/pg48"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">124.90H/67½</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by President Roosevelt to the Acting Secretary of
                            State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-03-16">March 16, 1942</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Why not name the regular Minister to Afghanistan now and get it over with?
                    Perhaps you can find someone from a demobilized Embassy or Legation.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>F[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ranklin</hi>] D. R[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">oosevelt</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
